{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Ox &amp; Horse Work in Hell&quot; players team up with their friends to take on the roles of Ox-Head and Horse-Face, the guardians of the underworld. Your daily work involves battling evil spirits, punishing them, and collecting Sin Points they drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/play.gif?t=1750838682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many ways to punish these evil spirits:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat them down directly with your fists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up items and smash them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tie up fallen ghosts on torture devices and vigorously torment them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize contraptions to create an assembly line of punishment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Incidental Encounters at Work</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your work in Hell will also involve interacting with various colleagues and superiors, leading to numerous interesting story snippets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/map.gif?t=1750838682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interesting Work Nodes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a break at Meng Po's shop, have some soup, and buy items and equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Report repairs or purchase new torture devices from the Judge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open treasure chests to claim free rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter unexpected events, such as being asked by a superior to run errands (maybe there's a reward?).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience some adult encounters with female ghosts or colleagues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have a brawl with colleagues to see who will be the outstanding employee of the day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooperative and competitive two-player gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of punishment torture devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large number of contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous evil spirits descending into Hell.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415340?t=1750838682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750838682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/8ab2ed36954dda041e6a7b4b7861c53aab465f3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750838682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/8ab2ed36954dda041e6a7b4b7861c53aab465f3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750838682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3469970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Ox &amp; Horse Work in Hell&quot; players team up with their friends to take on the roles of Ox-Head and Horse-Face, the guardians o